   b. Download the official releases of the Mod and use them to play, alone or
      on any server, public or private.
   c. Include the Mod in a modpack, as long as the modpack downloads the
      official, unmodified file from an official source (Modrinth, CurseForge
      or the GitHub releases of s00d/villager-life) rather than carrying a
      copy of it.
   d. Make and publish videos, streams, screenshots, reviews and guides that
      show the Mod, including monetised ones.
   e. Build the unmodified source code on your own computer for your personal
