Generated assets

Some of the Mod's assets were made with generative tools. They are part of the
Mod and come under this licence:

- Voices: Fish Audio S2 Pro, run locally (tools/voice/).
- Sound effects (sounds/sfx/): ElevenLabs Sound Effects v2 through fal
  (tools/art/sfx/, prompts in batch*.tsv; tools/art/fal/sfx/fal_manifest.jsonl).
- Music (all nine tracks): Google Lyria 3.5 through fal; the fair tune:
  ElevenLabs Music through fal (tools/art/fal/music/fal_manifest.jsonl).

Everything else (models, block textures, the icon, structures) is made by hand
or drawn by scripts in tools/art/.

Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang AB. The Mod is not an official Minecraft
product and is not approved by or associated with Mojang or Microsoft.
